"", "image": "engenn3le06ob06re2img01.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Silvia</span> : Some people here work in offices, and others work in cubicles.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: The offices look private and quiet. No distractions.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Silvia</span>: Yes. This cubicle is yours. You share the cubicle with Amanda. She's an intern too.", "image": "engenn3le06ob06re2img01.jpg", "time": "10", "id": 1}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Whose computer is this?<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Silvia</span>: This is your computer. That computer is Amanda's. Your message board is here, beside the computer.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Nice. Where are the supplies?", "image": "engenn3le06ob06re2img01.jpg", "time": "16000", "id": 2}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Silvia</span>: There are some supplies in your drawers. Your trash can is under the desk.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: My own desk! Cool!<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Silvia</span>: Everyone has their space and supplies. <br />", "image": "engenn3le06ob06re2img01.jpg", "time": "28250", "id": 3}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: What's this here?<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Silvia</span>: It's a filing cabinet. Amanda keeps her files here too.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: It's a nice workspace. What's this on the desk?", "image": "engenn3le06ob06re2img01.jpg", "time": "39500", "id": 4}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Silvia</span>: It's a key to the cabinet. <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Wow! My own key!", "image": "engenn3le06ob06re2img01.jpg", "time": "48750", "id": 5}]}}]}, {"title": "", "id": 2, "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "_data": [], "contents": [{"type": "picture", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn3le06ob06re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn3le06ob06re2img01.jpg", "images": []}}]}]}], "type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Peter Gets a Part-Time Job"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": " Is That My Place?"}, {"type": "position", "content": 6}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 6}, {"type": "level", "content": "A1.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately explain information about interests, hobbies, and preferences in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Prepositions of Place in the Office"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use prepositions of place to say where things are in an office space."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Your message board is beside the computer."}, {"type": "example", "content": "The trash can is under the desk."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Preposition</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Example </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"in\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> in the drawer </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"on\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> on the desk </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"under\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> under the desk </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"beside\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> beside the computer </span> \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": " There are some supplies in your drawers."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "workspace"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " the area where people work"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This is a nice open workspace."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob06aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you hear when someone shows you around at work."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "cubicle "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " a small area, with short walls, usually for one worker"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My work cubicle is here. It has a small desk and a computer."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob06aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "trash can "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a container for waste"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Put the old pens in the trash can."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob06aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "message board "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a place to put written comments or things to remember"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Put the note on the message board."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob06aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "supplies "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "things you need to do your job"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Your supplies are on the desk."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob06aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "drawer "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "part of a desk you pull out to put things into"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Your supplies are in the desk drawer."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob06aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "filing cabinet "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a  set of drawers for papers"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The documents are in this filing cabinet."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob06aud07"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn3le06ob06re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Find a picture of an office."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Choose 5 things in the picture."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Say what the things are in English."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Say where they are in the room."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write down your sentences."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about objects in an office."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I express the locations of objects."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write complete statements expressing location."}]}]}